{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"香港快運往濟洲班機　充電器過熱　乘客手部受傷\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/HKEXPRESS-FIRE-261015-22.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】香港快運前往濟洲班機有充電器過熱冒煙，乘客手部受傷。</p><p>香港快運表示，周日UO676航班上，乘客放於座位下方的外置充電器過熱冒煙，機組人員將充電器放入防火安全袋，情況受控。航班按原定計劃於當地時間早上6時安全降落，受傷乘客落機後由救護員檢查，並接受進一步治療。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:30.890116+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T14:18:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:58:05.269851+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:14:12.674417+00:00","content_hash":"8ed17743baf2e9fa9deabd0ee8e608925efdec9ed3854469198c791021528121","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:30.890116+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}